<title>UK: CE has 79.8 pct of Northern Electric.</title>
<headline>CE has 79.8 pct of Northern Electric.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. group CE Electric said on Friday it had 79.80 percent of regional electricity company (Rec) Northern Electric at 1300 GMT on January 9.</p>
<p>In a letter sent to Northern shareholders, CE Electric, which is controlled by CalEnergy, urged shareholders to accept its offer quickly.</p>
<p>Northern, which fought hard to retain its independence, finally recommended CE Electric's bid on December 30 after the American firm declared its offer unconditional on December 24.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
